== CANON-8 (r3.77): methods of generic structs come later; a generic routine does the job.
Type
    TPair<K, V> Struct
        FKey K
        FValue V
    ;

TPair<K, V>.Swap(Self mut) :
    PutLn("x")
;

Main :
    PutLn(1)
;
